# Dustwallow Marsh - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 10 confirmed in-band rares and the fixed world
# containers of Dustwallow Marsh. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end
# of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not
# up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever game
# data (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE dropper is the
# rare. Ordinary greens get a note, not a goal. No tame lines ship (the data
# has no tameability flag and the core guide carries no tame corroboration —
# see docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere,
# so none are stated. No rare in this guide is a giver, ender, or objective
# of any core-contracted quest (the Darkmist Widow's shared Darkmist Eye drop
# feeds the core 1206 hunt — noted, never accepted here). See
# docs/dustwallow-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory.
guide butler-routes-completionist/dustwallow-rares
title Dustwallow Marsh - Rares & Treasures
levels 35-45
zone Dustwallow Marsh
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords dustwallow, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Burgle Eye — the north-east shore

  zone map 1445

  goto 59.04,9.37
  kill 14230 optional
  collect 285095 "Twitching Eye" optional
  note Level 38 rare on the far north-east shore; its sole drop is the Twitching Eye. No quest takes it in the data.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

