step Darkmist Widow — the west

  zone map 1445

  goto 31.15,20.40
  kill 4380 optional
  collect 285102 "Darkmist Dirk" optional
  note Level 40 rare spider in the west; its sole drop is the Darkmist Dirk. It also drops Unpopped Darkmist Eyes — the core guide's 1206 hunt lives in dustwallow.guide, which owns that quest; this guide never accepts it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

