  note One sweep of the marsh's fixed world containers (68 unique points, said plainly): Solid Chests north-east and far south, Alliance Strongboxes and the Chest at the dwarf camp and the north dock, the Captain's Footlocker far east, Food Crates scattered south and center, the Armor/Weapon/Food crate cluster at the dwarf camp, the Food Crate and Barrel of Milk at the north dock, and the Damaged Crate south-center. All ordinary low-level goods.
  note The quest-owned containers are NOT covered here: Onyxia eggs (Horde quest), the Black Shield, Guard Badge, Musty Scroll, Waterlogged Book and Sweet Nectar barrel (all start quests elsewhere), catalogued in the inventory doc.

